# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:6
translate turkish workdressbetter_b2dcfd24:

    # "When I go into Mrs. Mills office, she looks at me with her nose scrunched up, like she just smelled something awful."
    "Bayan Mills’in ofisine girdiğimde, sanki az önce çok kötü bir koku almış gibi burnunu buruşturarak bana bakıyor."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:7
translate turkish workdressbetter_8f3aff5b:

    # pc "Is something wrong?"
    pc "Bir sorun mu var?"

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:8
translate turkish workdressbetter_922562fc:

    # bs "You know that you work in a professional environment, right?"
    bs "Profesyonel bir ortamda çalıştığının farkındasın, değil mi?"

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:9
translate turkish workdressbetter_9917bac8:

    # bs "Don't you have anything nicer to wear than this outfit?"
    bs "Bu kıyafetten daha şık bir şeyin yok mu?"

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:10
translate turkish workdressbetter_a6b99445:

    # bs "You look like a fanny-pack wearing vacation dad."
    bs "Bel çantası takan tatilci bir baba gibi görünüyorsun."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:11
translate turkish workdressbetter_f1daf0fc:

    # pc "Oh, um... I like these clothes."
    pc "Ah, şey... Bu kıyafetleri seviyorum."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:12
translate turkish workdressbetter_630696d3:

    # bs "Well I don't. You need to start dressing better at work. Immediately."
    bs "Ben sevmiyorum. İş yerinde daha iyi giyinmeye başlamalısın. Hemen."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:13
translate turkish workdressbetter_4af2b761:

    # pc "Okay. I guess I can do that."
    pc "Tamam. Sanırım bunu yapabilirim."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:15
translate turkish workdressbetter_e5ecd3ed:

    # bs "Just like a nice polo and some slacks are fine. A suit if you're feeling fancy. No jeans, no shorts."
    bs "Güzel bir polo tişört ve pantolon gayet uygun. Kendini şık hissediyorsan takım elbise de olur. Kot pantolon yok, şort yok."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:16
translate turkish workdressbetter_571316f2:

    # bs "Got it?"
    bs "Anladın mı?"

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:17
translate turkish workdressbetter_238bde54:

    # pc "Got it."
    pc "Anladım."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:18
translate turkish workdressbetter_b643f08e:

    # bs "Good. Let's get to work."
    bs "Güzel. Hadi işe koyulalım."

# game/Scenes/Work/workdressbetter.rpy:19
translate turkish workdressbetter_8c43722c:

    # "The rest of the day passes uneventfully. Until it's time to leave for the day."
    "Günün geri kalanı olaysız geçer. Ta ki işten çıkma vakti gelene kadar."

